    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Debora naBaraki bahula Sisera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baIsiraeli nibakhola akali amabii mumoni tsiOMWAMI khandi, olwa Ehudi yali namalile okhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nabakusia mumukhono kwaYabini omuruchi waKanaani, owali narukanga muHazori; ne omuseesia welihe yali Sisera, owamenya muHaroshetsi liamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana balsiraeli nibahaabila OMWAMI; okhuba omundu oyo yali namakaari keshibia ebikhumi shienda; yali namiinanga abaana baIsiraeli muno emiyika amakhumi kabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Debora, omunabii omukhasi, mukha Lapidotsi, yali nali omuyaasii muIsiraeli mundaalo etsio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yali niyeekhalanga mumusaala kwamashindu kwaDebora, hakari waRama naBeteli, mushialo shiebikulu shiaEfuraimu; nabo abaana baIsiraeli batikulukhanga nibamwitsila mbu abayaasie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye yarumana nalanga Baraki waAbinoamu okhurula eKedeshi-nafutali, namureeba mbu OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, shiyalaka mbu Tsia obakhung'aasie hashikulu shiaTabori, noba nabandu ebikhumila ekhumi abokhubaana baNafutali nabaana baZabuloni, ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi ndalakhukhwesela Sisera, omuseesia welihe liaYabini, hamwalo kwaKishoni, namakaarike nemikandachie; ne ndalamuhaana mumukhonokwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraki namukalusia mbu Nikhuba nikhutsia ninawe, kho ndalatsia; ne nikhuba nikhuratsia ninawe, kho shinzia ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ari Ee, toto, khulatsia ninawe; nebutswa oluchendo olwa oli okhutsia shilulakhuleerela iwe ifuma ta; okhuba OMWAMI alakusia Sisera mumukhono kwomukhasi. Mana Debora nabuukha, natsia eKedeshi, halala nende Baraki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Baraki nalanga Zabuloni nende Nafutali, bakhung'aanile eKedeshi, nibatikulukhayo abandu ebikhumila ekhumi, hamakuluke; Debora yesi natsia ninaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Heberi omuKeni yali niyeekabukhasia nabaKeni, mbu abaana baHobabu nyakhufialanyene Musa, niyakhoma liheemalie ehale, hamuruba kweZaananimu, ahambi naKedeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Sisera yaboolelwa mbu Baraki waAbinoamu utsiile hashikulu shiaTabori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Sisera nakhung'aasia amakaarike kosi, mbu amakaari keshibia ebikhumi shienda, nende abandu aba yali ninabo, nabarusia eHaroshetsi liamahanga, naboosia khumwalo kwaKishoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debora nasunjila Baraki mbu Rula! Okhuba yino niyo inyanga eya OMWAMI ahaanilakhwo Sisera mumukhonokwo. OMWAMI shiakhuranjiliile? Kho Baraki nakholomokha okhurula mushikulu shiaTabori, nabandu ebikhumila ekhumi abamulondakhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nakoyaasia Sisera, namakaarike kosi nende lihelie liosi, nende tsinganga, imbeli waBaraki; naye Sisera niyeekha okhurula mwikaarilie, niyeelukha nebilenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Baraki yalondachilila amakaari nende lihe elo, okhuula eHaroshetsi liamahanga; abelihe liosi liaSisera nibakwisibwa netsinganga; shiyasikala omundu kata mulala ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa Sisera omwene yeelukha nebilenje niyoola heeheema liaYaeli mukha Heberi omuKeni; okhuba Yabini omuruchi waHazori nabeinzu yaHeberi omuKeni bali nibalia omuuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yaeli narula, natsia okhwakaanila Sisera, namusunjila mbu Kotola, omwami; kotolela ewanje yino; oraria ta. Naye nakotola natsia ewa yali mwiheema; naye namufuunikhakhwo lirungeeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye namusunjila mbu Nochama, umbekhwo amatsi enywe; okhuba obuloho bundia. Naye nasibula eshisiikolo shiamabeele, namuha mbu anywe, namufuunikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye namuboolela mbu Sinjila hamuliango weliheema, mana olwa omundu yesi aba niyeetsa nareebakhwo ari Omundu alimwo noho? Iwe okalusie mbu Tawe, abulaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yaeli mukha Heberi nabukula eshibambo shieliheema, nabukula nende inyundo mumukhono, natsia kahala ewa yali, nakhupa eshibambo muluseeyalwe, nashio nishifutula putu okhuula hasi; okhuba yali naluyile muno, nakona tsindoolo tsinyinji; kho nafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, olwa Baraki yali nalondachila Sisera, Yaeli narula okhumakawanila, namusunjila mbu Yitsa, ekhumanyie omundu oyo owa okhaaba. Naye natsia; ne lola, Sisera ngwoyo, nakonile nafwile, neshibambo muluseeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho khunyanga eyo Nyasaye yahula Yabini omuruchi waKanaani imbeli wabaana baIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhono kwabaana baIsiraeli kwameetanga butswa okhuhula Yabini omuruchi waKanaani, okhuula olwa bali nibamalilaane Yabini omuruchi waKanaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
